  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Built Capacity in PCB and UPOP-UNDP-GMB-00110089</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to support the Gambia with the necessary technical and financial assistance to reduce the risks posed by PCBs and uPOPs to the environment and human health.The Gambia Government benefitted from a GEF funded project &#x201c;Capacity building for PCBs and uPOPs in The Gambia&#x201d;. The objective of the project is to protect Public Health and the Environment from risks of exposure to PCBs and uPOPs through the elimination of PCBs and the development of sustainable uPOPs management capacity</narrative>
  </description>
